        "description": "<p>Panorama is a 360° panorama viewer Gutenberg Block that lets you display your panoramic images/videos on your websites within a few clicks. This Gutenberg block supports a variety of panoramic files such as .png, .jpeg, .mp4 and so on. The plugin is very easy to use and anyone can use the plugin easily without any technical knowledge.</p>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Fully Customizable</strong>: All the options you need to arrange the showcase to your liking are available here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>How to use</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>First, install the Panorama Block plugin</li>\n<li>Add the Panorama Block from the block category called &#8220;Widgets&#8221; in the Gutenberg editor.</li>\n<li>You can change block settings from the right-side settings sidebar.</li>\n<li>\n<p>Enjoy!</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>For installation help click on Installation Tab.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Feedback</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Did you like this plugin? Dislike it? Have a feature request? <a href=\"mailto:&#115;u&#x70;&#112;&#x6f;&#114;&#x74;&#064;&#x62;&#112;l&#x75;&#103;&#x69;&#110;&#x73;&#046;&#x63;&#x6f;&#109;\" title=\"Send feedback\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Please share your feedback with us</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>⭐ Check out the Parent Plugin of this plugin-</h3>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bblockswp.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">B Blocks</a></strong> – Best gutenberg blocks collections for WordPress</p>\n<h3>⭐ Check out our other WordPress Plugins-</h3>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/html5-audio-player\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Html5 Audio Player</a></strong> – Best audio player plugin for WordPress.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/html5-video-player\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Html5 Video Player</a></strong> – Best video player plugin for WordPress.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/pdf-poster\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">PDF Poster</a></strong> – A fully-featured PDF Viewer Plugin for WordPress.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/document-embedder\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Document Embedder</a></strong> – Best WordPress Document Embedder Plugin.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/3d-viewer\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">3D Viewer</a></strong> – Display interactive 3D models on the webs.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/advanced-post-block\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Advanced Post Block</a></strong> – Best Post Display Plugin for WordPress.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<h4>From Gutenberg Editor:</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to the WordPress Block/Gutenberg Editor</li>\n<li>Search For <strong>Panorama Block</strong></li>\n<li>Click on the <strong>Panorama Block</strong> to add the block</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>Download &amp; Upload:</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the <strong>Panorama Block</strong> plugin (<em>.zip file</em>)</li>\n<li>In your admin area, go to the Plugins menu and click on <strong>Add New</strong></li>\n<li>Click on <strong>Upload Plugin</strong> and choose the <strong><code>panorama-block.zip</code></strong> file and click on <strong>Install Now</strong></li>\n<li>Activate the plugin and Enjoy!</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>Manually:</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Download and upload the <strong>Panorama Block</strong> plugin to the <strong><code>/wp-content/plugins/</code></strong> directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the Plugins menu in WordPress</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='is%20panorama%20block%20free%3F'>\nIs Panorama Block free?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, Panorama Block is a free Gutenberg Block plugin.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='does%20it%20work%20with%20any%20wordpress%20theme%3F'>\nDoes it work with any WordPress theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, it will work with any standard WordPress theme.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='can%20i%20change%20block%20settings%3F'>\nCan I change block settings?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, you can change block settings from the Gutenberg block editor&#8217;s right sidebar.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='how%20many%20times%20can%20i%20reuse%20a%20block%3F'>\nHow many times can I reuse a block?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You can use unlimited times as you want.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='where%20can%20i%20get%20support%3F'>\nWhere can I get support?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You can post your questions on the <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/panorama-block\" rel=\"ugc\">support forum here</a></p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.1.1 &#8211; 6 May 25</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix Inline Media in settings panel.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.0 &#8211; 16 April 25</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix Autorotate speed issue and customize settings panel.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.5 &#8211; 9 Mar 24</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix live url issue.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Improve Performance</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Not loading assets if block is not present</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix backend select</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added Screenshots</li>\n<li>Improve Performance.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial Release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
